---

<section id="services" class="promises-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" data-animate>
      <p class="section-label">OUR COMMITMENT</p>
      <h2>Built on These Promises</h2>
      <p class="section-description">
        Every UD truck is engineered to exceed expectations and deliver maximum value to your business.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="promises-grid">
      <!-- Promise 1: Fuel Efficiency -->
      <div class="promise-card" data-animate>
        <div class="promise-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M6 12h12M12 6v12M9 9l6-6M9 15l6 6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Fuel Efficiency</h3>
        <p>
          Advanced engine technology reduces fuel consumption by up to 15%, 
          delivering better mileage and lower operational costs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Promise 2: Lower Maintenance -->
      <div class="promise-card" data-animate>
        <div class="promise-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2m-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Lower Maintenance</h3>
        <p>
          Durable components and smart engineering mean less downtime and 
          reduced maintenance costs throughout the vehicle's lifecycle.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Promise 3: Guaranteed Uptime -->
      <div class="promise-card" data-animate>
        <div class="promise-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Guaranteed Uptime</h3>
        <p>
          Reliable performance when you need it most. Our robust design ensures 
          minimal downtime and maximum productivity for your fleet.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Promise 4: Higher Productivity -->
      <div class="promise-card" data-animate>
        <div class="promise-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/>
            <path d="M9 9h6v6H9z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Higher Productivity</h3>
        <p>
          Optimized performance metrics deliver more output per trip, 
          helping you maximize revenue and minimize costs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Promise 5: Connectivity -->
      <div class="promise-card" data-animate>
        <div class="promise-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M1 9l2 2c4.97-4.97 13.03-4.97 18 0l2-2C16.93 2.93 7.08 2.93 1 9m8 8l3 3 3-3c-1.65-1.66-4.34-1.66-6 0m-4-4l2 2c2.76-2.76 7.24-2.76 10 0l2-2C15.14 9.14 8.87 9.14 5 13z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Smart Connectivity</h3>
        <p>
          Real-time monitoring, predictive maintenance alerts, and fleet management 
          integration for smarter decision-making.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Promise 6: Sustainable Solutions -->
      <div class="promise-card" data-animate>
        <div class="promise-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2m0 18c-4.41 0-8-3.59-8-8s3.59-8 8-8 8 3.59 8 8-3.59 8-8 8m3.5-9c.83 0 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5S16.33 8 15.5 8 14 8.67 14 9.5s.67 1.5 1.5 1.5zm-7 0c.83 0 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5S9.33 8 8.5 8 7 8.67 7 9.5 7.67 11 8.5 11z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Sustainable Solutions</h3>
        <p>
          Environmentally responsible engineering reduces emissions while 
          maintaining superior performance and reliability.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .promises-section {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-secondary) 0%, var(--bg-primary) 100%);
    position: relative;
  }

  .promises-section::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--accent), transparent);
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .section-description {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
  }

  .promises-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .promise-card {
    background: rgba(45, 45, 45, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.1);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .promise-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.1) 0%, transparent 100%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .promise-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(45, 45, 45, 0.6);
    transform: translateY(-10px);
  }

  .promise-card:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .promise-icon {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .promise-icon svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    stroke: var(--accent);
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .promise-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
  }

  .promise-card p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .promises-section {
      padding: 4rem 0;
    }

    .section-header {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .promises-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .promise-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .promise-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
